  "description": "Test build of Shaco as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Shaco. Backstab: his attacks and shivs deal the backstab bonus when he hits an enemy champion from behind, judged from where the target walks or faces (the main pack's backstab needs a crowd-controlled target, since data cannot read facing). Hallucinate (0.2.0): the clone is a unit of its own through the mod API's spawn_unit - it walks, attacks (10 + 40% of his attack a hit), takes 50% more damage, can be killed, and bursts where it ends (the main pack's clone and damage ride on the target); a host that gives no unit plays the main pack's clone. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
